## Agent checklist before finishing a form change

- [ ] Schema imported from `@/lib/validation`
- [ ] Every editable text field has a `fieldType`
- [ ] No ad-hoc toast validation for empty/charset
- [ ] Errors are calm and specific (Quirri §34)
